                    <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-cyan-800">Taxonomy Management</h2>
                    <p className="mb-4 text-gray-600">Manage categories, industries, and platform structure.</p>
                    <Link 
                        to="/admin/taxonomy" 
